# Delta Quadrant  

  

## Overview  

  

The Delta Quadrant is one of the four major divisions of the Milky Way Galaxy. It is among the most distant regions from Federation space and contains many of the galaxy's most powerful and mysterious civilizations.  

  

The Delta Quadrant became well known to Alpha Quadrant powers through the journey of the [[USS Voyager]], which was transported there by the [[Caretaker]] in 2371.  

  

The quadrant is home to the [[Borg Collective]], making it one of the most strategically significant and dangerous regions in known space.  

  

---  

  

